Body:
To make Enter insert a newline and Ctrl+Enter submit, use:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/tui.json",
  "keybinds": {
    "input_newline": "return",
    "input_submit": "linefeed"
  }
}
```
[You can check out the details here](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/1505#issuecomment-5479570580)

AppleScript coercion: `the clipboard as "PNGf"` costs about 200ms per megabyte, so a 12MB screenshot takes 2.5s. Spawning `osascript` is only 40ms of it on my laptop.

#46456 reads the pasteboard through the ObjC bridge instead. 2500ms → 167ms at 12MB (no new dependency & behavior unchanged).

